'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is one of the four pillars of gameplay in ''Stationeers'', this game loop allows astronauts to undertake away missions to gather resources or complete tasks for non-player characters. The rewards go towards building and exploitation. It does not exist at this point in time, and all articles in this sub-category are from the imaginations of authors on this site.

==Overview==
;There are four primary kinds of missions available: 
* [[Scavenging]]: Salvaging derelict space stations.
* [[Resourcing]]: Exploiting [[resources]] from asteroid belts and other resource-rich locations.
* [[Assault]]: Clear stations of aliens.
* [[Rescue]]: Provide medical treatment to injured NPCs.
* [[Transport]]: Move characters or cargo from one location to another.
* [[Repair]]: Conduct repairs at the target location.
